    "history_intro": "Five chapters of real campaigns. Each battle ends on a checked mate in one. The position is an exercise, not a reconstruction of the historical game.",
    "history_ch_1": "Spring and Autumn",
    "history_ch_2": "Warring States",
    "history_ch_3": "Chu and Han",
